{"hw":"ἀναβιβάζω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἀναβιβάζω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀναβιβ-άζω</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">fut.</span> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <span class=\"gk\">-βιβάσω</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ph.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Bel.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">97.43</span> </span> (s.v.l.): <span class=\"lex-gram\">aor.</span> <span class=\"gk\">-εβίβασα</span>:— <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Med.</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">fut.</span> <span class=\"gk\">-βιβάσομαι,</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Att.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">-βιβῶμαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Amips.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">30</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Aeschin.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.146</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">aor.</span> <span class=\"gk\">-εβιβασάμην</span>: (v. <span class=\"gk\">βιβάζω</span>):—causal of <span class=\"gk\">ἀναβαίνω,</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">make to go up, cause to mount,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ἐπὶ τὴν πυρήν, ἐπὶ πύργον,</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.86</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.75</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cyr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.1.53</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐπὶ τὸν τροχόν,</span> of torture, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">And.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.43</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">κατὰ τὸ ἀκρότατον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HG</cite> <span c